config EXYNOS_GNSS_IF_SPI
	tristate "Samsung Kepler GNSS interface over SPI"
	depends on SPI && GPIOLIB && OF
	select WANT_DEV_COREDUMP
	help
	  Google's driver for the Kepler GNSS core in Samsung's S5300 modem,
	  as in the Pixel 9a. gnss_spi binds the core's SPI device, and
	  gnssif binds its two request lines and gives the GNSS daemon the
	  character device /dev/gnss_ipc. The core runs only while the modem
	  is up, with firmware the daemon loads through the modem driver.

	  To compile this driver as modules, choose M here: the modules will
	  be called gnss_spi and gnssif.
